<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1361518" n="1"/>
  <opener><abbr>Ill.<unclear><hi rend="sup">mo</hi></unclear></abbr> et <abbr>Doctiss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr> Viro <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-119166895">Nicolao Bernoulli</rs> <lb/><rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-102552517">Petrus <abbr>Ant.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr> Michelotti</rs> <abbr>S. P. D.</abbr></opener>
  <p><lb/>Obstupesco quod aliquis minime Tibi cognitus ausus fuerit
      <lb/>mihi commendare ut ad Te mitterem <rs type="lostletter">epistolam</rs> quam
      <lb/>iniquam suspicor. Bona fide ego ad te misi <rs type="lostletter">epistolam</rs>
      <lb/>tametsi <rs type="person">Monachum</rs> neutiquam cognosco. Ut rei veri<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tatem propriis oculis conspicias et veluti manu
      <lb/>tangas, mitto ad Te <rs type="lostletter">epistolam</rs><note type="editorial">Dieses Begleitschreiben an Michelotti ist bereits in Nicolaus I Bernoullis <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517051005501">Brief</rs> vom 20. November 1718 erwähnt.</note> illius, qui <rs key="place_GEO-3169070" type="place">Rom<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice></rs> scri<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>bere videtur <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>a dato</expan></choice> <date when="1718-11-12">12 Nov.<hi rend="sup">bris</hi> 1718</date> sub nomine <rs type="person">Alberti
      <lb/>Friderici Gutt</rs>. Rogat <subst><del>ipse</del><add>ille</add></subst> nequam ut respondeam
      <lb/>responsumque mittam <rs key="place_GEO-3169070" type="place">Romam</rs> ricapito a <rs type="organisation"><abbr>S.</abbr> Isidoro</rs><note type="comment">Franziskanerkloster in Rom.</note>
      <lb/>al Padre <rs type="person">ô Kely</rs> <rs type="organisation">Lettore di Teologia</rs>. Misterium non
      <lb/>intelligo. Ego a te admonitus non respondebo, et
      <lb/>perlibenter a Te sciam quid contineat tua <rs type="letter">epistola</rs>.
      <lb/>De <rs type="person">Carolo Baldo</rs> sive <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-1089923198">Verzaglia</rs> Te hortor ut respon<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>deas sed non tuo nomine, tetegasque pergrandes
      <lb/>errores et paralogismos in illo <rs type="biblio">libello</rs> famoso contentos.
      <lb/>De <rs type="organisation">Professione <rs key="place_GEO-2934691" type="place">Duisburgensi</rs></rs> nihil ad me scripsit <abbr>Cele<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>berr.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr> <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-118509969">Patruus</rs>.</p> <closer><salute>Vale Vir Amicissime, meque amare
      <lb/>perge.</salute><dateline>Dabam <rs key="place_VER-repven" type="place">Venetiis</rs> <date when="1718-11-23"><choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>a dato</expan></choice> 23 Nov.<hi rend="sup">bris</hi> 1718</date>.</dateline></closer><note hand="pers_DE-588-119166895"><foreign xml:lang="ger"><abbr>Empf.</abbr> den <date when="1718-11-24">24<hi rend="sup">ten</hi></date></foreign></note>
</div>
</body>
</text></TEI>